   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dare del Lei and dare del tu",
     "texto": [
      "**Dare del Lei** (to address formally), **dare del tu** (to address informally). When addressing someone formally, **Lei** is used with the third-person verb: **Lei è gentile** (you are kind).",
      "Moving to tu is suggested with **Ci diamo del tu?** (shall we use tu?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Politeness formulas",
     "texto": [
      "**Mi permetta** (allow me), **Con permesso** (excuse me), **Prego, si accomodi** (please, take a seat). For a person addressed as **Lei**: **Le dispiace?** (does it bother you?).",
      "**Vi dispiace?** is normally addressed to several people."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
